#: ../../source/docs/building-apm-for-flymaple.rst:23
#: a63d8e248de140ca9c35f4b22ba36349
msgid ""
"Flymaple is an inexpensive board based on a 75MHz ARM Cortex-M3 processor."
msgstr "Flymaple 是一款基于 75MHz ARM Cortex-M3 处理器的低成本开发板。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm-for-flymaple.rst:25
#: df4e6a10a29e471a8f44c5d050c2f610
msgid ""
"It includes 10DOF sensors (accelerometer, gyroscope, magnetometer and "
"barometer)."
msgstr "它包含 10DOF 传感器（加速度计、陀螺仪、磁力计和气压计）。"

