#: ../../source/docs/building-apm-for-flymaple.rst:37
#: c7db073dca724c99801d00a0eba2699e
msgid ""
"You need a number of additional resources to build ardupilot for Flymaple."
msgstr "您需要一些额外资源来为 Flymaple 构建 ardupilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-apm-for-flymaple.rst:38
#: 9c14cbe448074d03af5c1aad5a841ffc
msgid "I have assumed that you will install them in your home directory."
msgstr "我假设您将把它们安装在您的主目录中。"

